WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.464
Roxy rushed into Mrs. Bun's house.

2
00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:10.646
Mrs. Bun was hiding under a table.

3
00:00:10.647 --> 00:00:12.935
She peeked out at Roxy.

4
00:00:12.936 --> 00:00:17.173
"They're upstairs," Mrs. Bun whispered.

5
00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:20.056
"The robbers?" asked Roxy.

6
00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:22.580
"They're not robbers."

7
00:00:22.581 --> 00:00:29.189
Mrs. Bun looked really scared. "They're . . . bugs!"

8
00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:33.753
Roxy flew upstairs and gasped.

9
00:00:33.754 --> 00:00:37.457
Webs were everywhere.

10
00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:40.644
A giant centipede charged down the hallway.

11
00:00:40.645 --> 00:00:43.388
It knocked over furniture as it went by.

12
00:00:43.389 --> 00:00:46.436
A large bee flew behind the centipede.

13
00:00:46.437 --> 00:00:49.198
The bee was carrying a sack of money.

14
00:00:49.199 --> 00:00:52.580
A big spider ran along the ceiling.

15
00:00:52.581 --> 00:00:57.183
The bugs went out through an open window.

16
00:00:57.184 --> 00:01:00.260
Roxy ran to the window and looked down.

17
00:01:00.261 --> 00:01:02.417
A man stood in the yard.

18
00:01:02.418 --> 00:01:06.094
He wore big goggles and a helmet with two antennae.

19
00:01:06.095 --> 00:01:09.047
"Von Buzz!" thought Roxy.

20
00:01:09.048 --> 00:01:13.095
"Well done, pets," the villain told the bugs.

21
00:01:13.096 --> 00:01:15.491
"Now let's go!

22
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:19.135
We have lots of houses to rob today!"

23
00:01:19.136 --> 00:01:22.275
"Stop right there!" yelled Roxy.

24
00:01:22.276 --> 00:01:25.388
She jumped down to the ground.

25
00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:27.585
Von Buzz spun around.

26
00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:32.579
His eyes went wide with surprise. "Rocket Girl!"

27
00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.724
"I'm not letting you steal that money," said Roxy.

28
00:01:36.725 --> 00:01:40.086
"Ha-ha!" Von Buzz laughed.

29
00:01:40.087 --> 00:01:42.543
"You can't stop me!

30
00:01:42.544 --> 00:01:46.350
I discovered a way to grow big bugs.

31
00:01:46.351 --> 00:01:51.379
Nobody will ever stop me from stealing again!"

32
00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.247
"I will stop you," said Roxy.

33
00:01:54.248 --> 00:01:57.152
"And then I'll take you back to jail."

34
00:01:57.153 --> 00:01:59.183
Von Buzz grinned.

35
00:01:59.184 --> 00:02:02.989
"Oh, I'm never going back to jail.

36
00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:06.296
It was an awful place."

37
00:02:06.297 --> 00:02:08.661
He touched the side of his helmet.

38
00:02:08.662 --> 00:02:11.131
"Attack Rocket Girl!"

39
00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:15.046
The big centipede charged toward Roxy.

40
00:02:15.047 --> 00:02:20.420
Its sharp claws snapped open and shut. Click! Click!

41
00:02:20.421 --> 00:02:24.671
Whiz-hoo! Roxy shot her eye laser beams.

42
00:02:24.672 --> 00:02:27.399
They blasted a small hole in the ground.

43
00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.960
The big centipede jumped back.

44
00:02:29.961 --> 00:02:34.114
The centipede looked nervously at Roxy.

45
00:02:34.115 --> 00:02:37.713
"Attack her!" Von Buzz said again.

46
00:02:37.714 --> 00:02:40.945
The centipede took a tiny step toward Roxy.

47
00:02:40.946 --> 00:02:45.433
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams again.

48
00:02:45.434 --> 00:02:48.177
The centipede jumped back once more.

49
00:02:48.178 --> 00:02:50.739
Then it curled up into a ball.

50
00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:54.827
Von Buzz stamped his foot. "Aargh!"

51
00:02:54.828 --> 00:02:56.995
"Ha!" Roxy laughed.

52
00:02:56.996 --> 00:03:00.830
"Your big centipede is afraid of me, Von Buzz!"

53
00:03:00.831 --> 00:03:03.244
Von Buzz ignored Roxy.

54
00:03:03.245 --> 00:03:05.609
He touched the side of his helmet again.

55
00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:10.023
"Attack Rocket Girl."

56
00:03:10.024 --> 00:03:12.402
The spider ran past Roxy.

57
00:03:12.403 --> 00:03:17.144
Roxy turned around and watched as it quickly spun a large web.

58
00:03:17.145 --> 00:03:21.176
Suddenly the bee crashed into her. Pow!

59
00:03:21.177 --> 00:03:23.614
"Oof!" cried Roxy.

60
00:03:23.615 --> 00:03:27.010
She flew through the air and landed on the web.

61
00:03:27.011 --> 00:03:31.036
Roxy tried to move, but the web was too sticky.

62
00:03:31.037 --> 00:03:37.929
"Oh no!" she cried. "I'm stuck!"

